# w.lang.en/shards/hand-frames: argument frames written in this repository where a host found a sentence no frame of
# the hand-over reads right (block 20:15, from PSys2): the named add with a place verb and a place ("Put a guest
# named Maria at table 1."): acts.make.name.p takes the rest as the name ("Maria At Table 1"); this frame ends the name
# before the place preposition, as acts.make.name.place does for the verbs of make.
# sources: hand-core 1 (written in this repository after PSys2's question; same parts as acts.make.name.place)
# license: CC0-1.0
# script: none (hand-written)

